WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.994
The brief identifies the executive’s contribution Lindiwe makes the

00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:10.665
investment decision within her authority Daniel identifies the contribution

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:15.047
that actually needs her time Finance and operations remain

00:00:15.099 --> 00:00:18.994
responsible for their submissions Daniel’s role is to coordinate

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.073
them and make readiness gaps visible
